      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A new technique has been used in dogs to make combined measurements in vivo of conduction delay, action potentials, and epicardial ST-segment during myocardial ischaemia. These measurements should provide new information about ionic and metabolic cellular changes relating to the onset of ventricular arrhythmias."},
